  <div class="bio">
    <p>Adrián Hernández is a music producer, sound designer,<br class="salto-bio"> creative director and graphic designer based in Madrid.</p>
    <p>Sonically, his work sits at the intersection of computer music and<br class="salto-bio"> internet culture, spanning electronic and avant-garde production<br class="salto-bio"> under his alias Joven Promesa Main Serenata, as well as sound<br class="salto-bio"> design for visual media and commercial projects.</p>
    <p>That same sensibility carries into his design work, where he<br class="salto-bio"> develops visual identities, creative direction and graphic design<br class="salto-bio"> for artists and brands, with an intuitive sense of composition<br class="salto-bio"> and a fluency in pop culture.</p>
    <p>Across sound and image, his practice is shaped<br class="salto-bio"> by a contemporary, digital edge.</p>
